          "id": "dirichlet-grh-hypothesis",
          "statement": "The theorem uses the generalized Riemann hypothesis for Dirichlet L-functions, which Alpöge proved (Lean Verified on our quasi-Riemann board, linked). The Lean theorem takes it as a hypothesis (DirichletLZerosOnLine), the default target also imports proved lemmas of the same development, and the author did not compile the full import of that proof.",
