          "status": "unverified"
        },
        {
          "id": "author-cost-model",
          "statement": "The cost is counted in a bit-charge model defined in the Lean files, not in the board's Mathlib machine model. The full import of the GRH files was not compiled by the author, and we have not rebuilt the proof.",
